@startuml
title Sequence - Workspace Export

actor User
participant "PopupUI\nWorkspaceExtra" as UI
participant "WorkspaceService" as Service

User -> UI: Click export button\n(single/multiple/all)

alt Export single
  UI -> Service: exportWorkspacesToJson([name])
else Export multiple
  UI -> Service: exportWorkspacesToJson([names[]])
else Export all
  UI -> Service: exportAllWorkspacesToJson()
end

Service -> Service: collect WorkspaceItem\ninstances from workspaceMap

Service -> Service: serialize to JSON:
Service -> Service: for each WorkspaceItem\n  convert to Workspace model
Service -> Service: build StoredState structure
Service -> Service: JSON.stringify()

Service --> UI: return JSON string

UI -> UI: create blob
UI -> UI: generate filename\nworkspace-export-timestamp.json

UI -> UI: trigger download\nvia <a href> click

@enduml
